# Incident Response Time Report, September 2026

Monthly report of measured first-response times per severity, with the number of breaches. The committed targets are not reproduced in the report.

## Scope reference — CONT-08: Incident response times measured against targets
Requirement addressed: Response times are measured monthly against the committed targets and breaches are counted.

- Reporting period: 2026-09-01 to 2026-09-30.
- Measured response time: Recorded in EV-017 (Incident Response Time Report, September 2026).
- Breach count: Recorded in EV-017 (Incident Response Time Report, September 2026).

